                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Hello. I’d like to get a new pair of glasses. I recently got a promotion, and I think the pair I have now is too casual for work.\\nB: All right, ma’am. Are you going to be changing your prescription? If so, we perform eye tests on site.\\nA: No, thanks. I just need new frames with the same prescription. And I’d like to get two different pairs. I can use this coupon toward them, can’t I?\\nB: Hmm... yes, that’s right. Let me show you our selection, and you can start trying on the frames that you think might be right for you.\"}]]}]]}"
